business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"x7_p5O3ChQa7shdHCcLHZQ","review_id":"T37h5STlFJtOY7WgX3k4jQ","date":"2011-01-06T03:05:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.922767698764801,"text_excerpt":"Wonderful, non-pretentious restaurant with fantastic creole cooking and very attentive staff. The significant-other unit and I made our new year's eve reservation here and had some bon temps indeed! I ordered the new potatoes with caviar and cream as my appetizer, and he ordered the mushroom roulade. Both delicate and delicious, and in a smallish but good sized portion. I then had the duck breast, and he had the rabbit. A first for both of us, and melt-in-your-mouth good. Amazing flavor, expertly cooked. Great wine list, particularly because they had moscato d'asti! Our waitress was awesome, funny, conversational, and super attentive. I would come back in a heartbeat! Merci!"},{"business_id":"x7_p5O3ChQa7shdHCcLHZQ","review_id":"ASZRkylrqg3Bz1zMhN9NUg","date":"2014-02-14T18:11:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9222345352172852,"text_excerpt":"Here is where I went crazy for one bite. One bite of the shrimp scampi ($25) was so much different from my hometown's own version. Pair up the rice, the shrimp, the light garlic and chive white wine sauce on your fork----BAM! The taste buds are happy in one bite. My friend had the creole trio ($28) which was a variety dish of blackened fish, crawfish étouffée and shrimp jambalaya. The best part of her dish was the crawfish étouffée. It was nothing like my dish but had a little more spice and a grittier bite to it. Personally, I'd opt for another menu selection but she was happy. There is a complimentary cornbread that is soaked in honey for those who crave the taste of something sweet. Th..."},{"business_id":"x7_p5O3ChQa7shdHCcLHZQ","review_id":"XUz2ISDq7V7uKeo8JGR9mg","date":"2012-11-20T05:25:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9206768274307251,"text_excerpt":"Classy and tasty! So the chica and I were walking around, trying to get away from the tourist trap bars and restaurants of the French Quarter, so we headed towards the warehouse district, which is still touristy, but significantly less so that the FQ and French Market. While walking down the street equipped with cell phone in hand like Dr. McCoy walking the surface of a strange planet with his tricorder and scanner in hand, we came upon Olivier's. We peeped the menu, the prices and kept it moving. After being unable to find some Creole cuisine at a place with more than 3 stars, we returned to Ovilier's, and boy are we glad we did. The food, service and atmosphere here is AH-MA-ZING. Nick ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"x7_p5O3ChQa7shdHCcLHZQ","photo_id":"zvQtTThaiQJhFK6ZntKcng","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/zvQtTThaiQJhFK6ZntKcng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9226773381233215},{"business_id":"x7_p5O3ChQa7shdHCcLHZQ","photo_id":"VU1M_BMkgMve7SRYOFpMFw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VU1M_BMkgMve7SRYOFpMFw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8424254655838013},{"business_id":"x7_p5O3ChQa7shdHCcLHZQ","photo_id":"mClTsp_iSpjs4XKps7ksKg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/mClTsp_iSpjs4XKps7ksKg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8424254655838013},{"business_id":"x7_p5O3ChQa7shdHCcLHZQ","photo_id":"Rhdx_Ap6woNBOQbnvjj8MA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Rhdx_Ap6woNBOQbnvjj8MA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8412481546401978},{"business_id":"x7_p5O3ChQa7shdHCcLHZQ","photo_id":"6pS41YzE90kBi5Uvu-FnAg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6pS41YzE90kBi5Uvu-FnAg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8294967412948608}]},"notebook_case":null}
